DESCRIPTION:Duration: 1h 54m (114 mins)\n\nThree witches tell General Macb
 eth that he will be King of Scotland. Encouraged by his wife\, Macbeth kil
 ls the king\, becomes king\, and kills more people out of paranoia. Civil 
